below this threshold. If this attribute is
absent, activeEacThreshold is used to trigger
deactivation of eACMode.""" ;
            sh:maxCount 1 ;
            sh:path nsacf3gpp:NsacfInfoSnssai.deactiveEacThreshold ],
        [ sh:datatype xsd:unsignedShort ;
